{
  "name": "75 - TOOL - start_enrichment",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Paid external read, bounded\nStarts one background enrichment job for prospects that have a LinkedIn company URL and no contact email yet. The worker (76) makes one bounded Apify actor run (harvestapi/linkedin-company-employees, one-by-one batch, 3 profiles per company, hard cost ceiling) and one Claude call per company to pick the best contact without guessing.\n\nIt never sends email and never writes outside the local prospect store. Requires the user-created 'Apify API' Header Auth credential; without it the job fails with a clear message and no charge.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -650,
        -400
      ],
      "id": "75000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Enrichment start explanation"
    },
